
WalT platform control tool
-> advanced sub-commands

Usage:
    walt advanced SUBCOMMAND [args...]

Help about a given subcommand:
    walt advanced SUBCOMMAND --help

Help about WalT in general:
    walt help show

Sub-commands:
    update-hub-meta         update hub metadata (docker images pushed without walt)
    rescan-hub-account      alias to 'update-hub-meta' subcommand
    dump-bash-autocomplete  dump bash auto-completion code
    dump-zsh-autocomplete   dump zsh auto-completion code
    update-default-images   update default images (images of free nodes)
    set-free-nodes-image    let free nodes boot the specified OS image
    fix-image-owner         fix the owner of images
    sql                     start a remote SQL prompt on the WalT server database

